{
  "_README": [
    "Property manifest for the control versions this app pins.",
    "",
    "'rejected' is empirically confirmed: Power Apps Studio raised PA2108 for",
    "that exact property on that exact control version. These are hard failures.",
    "",
    "'known' is the inventory of properties currently emitted, extracted from",
    "solution/canvas/Src. It is NOT an authoritative allow-list - Microsoft does",
    "not publish machine-readable control property sets, and inventing one from",
    "memory is precisely the mistake that produced the PA2108 round trips. Its",
    "job is change detection: a property outside this list is new and unverified,",
    "so tools/paste_check.py flags it for confirmation rather than letting it",
    "ship silently.",
    "",
    "When a paste confirms a new property, add it here. When a paste rejects one,",
    "move it to 'rejected' with the error code so it can never come back.",
    "",
    "FluidGrid@2.3.0 and DataCard@1.0.2 were added for the scrollable-screen",
    "pattern in canvas-apps-output/mockup/. Their 'known' lists are the",
    "properties that pattern emits, NOT a confirmed inventory - no screen in",
    "this repo used either control before. Confirm with a paste, then trim or",
    "extend these lists."
  ],
